TITLE Ba-Sulfate solution temperature ramp v2

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mg/L
    Ba        2.0
    S(6)      15.0
    -water    1.0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    25.0  39.0  53.0  67.0  81.0  95.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     ba_sulfate2.out
    -reset    false
    -temperature  true
    -step         true
    -sim          true
    -specific_conductance true

END
